{"id":"0021d62712fe298e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-branch.md","title":"Ordered decision tree","display":"df-branch — Ordered decision tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-branch","aliases":["27-df-branch"],"display":"df-branch — Ordered decision tree","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.5 Theorem 2.5 and binary enumeration tree discussion","source_printed_pages":"80–81","source_pdf_pages":"104–105","verification_status":"source-framework-checked-explicit-full-tree-specialization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-branch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-branch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-branch — Ordered decision tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5 Theorem 2.5 and binary enumeration tree discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80–81"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"104–105"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-framework-checked-explicit-full-tree-specialization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\">\\(\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\\)</span> 为双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq k\\leq n\">\\(0\\leq k\\leq n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}\\)</span>。叶标签与内部节点使用互异的元组标签 0、1。见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{[n]}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,n)\\coloneqq\\langle0,f(\\beta)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{[n]}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,n)\\coloneqq\\langle0,f(\\beta)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,k)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\rho(k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),0)\\},k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),1)\\},k+1)\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,k)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\rho(k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),0)\\},k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),1)\\},k+1)\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\emptyset,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\emptyset,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是未剪枝的固定变量次序全决策树。按 n−k 递减递归，标签始终保留原坐标，不会在降维后错用旧索引；叶子只有在 β 的定义域覆盖 [n] 时才求 f(β)。它是原书 branching 框架的简单特例，不冒称为包含 Preprocess 的完整算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$\\rho:[n]\\to[n]$ 为双射；$0\\leq k\\leq n$，$\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}$。叶标签与内部节点使用互异的元组标签 0、1。见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq k\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{[n]}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,n)\\coloneqq\\langle0,f(\\beta)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb B^{\\{\\rho(1),\\ldots,\\rho(k)\\}}\\;\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta,k)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle1,\\rho(k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),0)\\},k+1),\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\beta\\cup\\{(\\rho(k+1),1)\\},k+1)\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Br}_{f,\\rho}(\\emptyset,0).","display":true}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-branch|df-branch — Ordered decision tree]]"},{"id":"e1959988c4da830e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$\\rho:[n]\\to[n]$ 为双射；带标签的 $\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)$ 见 [[27-df-branch]]。下式构造有限二叉树的语法载体 $\\mathcal T_n$，并在该载体上递归定义叶数 $\\lambda$ 和节点数 $\\nu$。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}